@@ -1,44 +0,0 @@
-Phase 3 scope (agreed)
-
-Android-only. Compile-safe. New features gated on availability, not presented as confirmed without a real adapter/vehicle.
-
-Priority order:
-1. Mode 06 monitor-results decode + UI
-   - Add a Mode 06 monitor-test decoder in PidDecoders for the known SAE J1979 monitor test IDs where definitions exist.
-   - Keep unknown IDs as raw; never claim universal pass/fail.
-   - Surface Mode 06 in Diagnostics / AdvancedDiagnostics with explicit availability badges.
-
-2. Trip history as a real log
-   - Promote today's session-based trip computer to a persistent trip log.
-   - Keep TripHistoryStore or migrate to Room; show trip history on the trip page.
-   - Add trip export/share (CSV first; PDF as a later rendering step only if scope allows).
